{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13112221","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13112221","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1311222101:0":{"text":"安排？咳……我现在每天只能吃药、休息，然后再接着吃药。不能去花园照顾我的花，最多在房间里散散步，可无聊了……","source_cn":"安排？咳……我现在每天只能吃药、休息，然后再接着吃药。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C2B7C14900E3178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311222102:0":{"text":"连<style=\"highlight\">莉娅女士</style>都劝说我，不让我出门。唉，她以前都会帮我偷偷准备修花剪的！","source_cn":"连<style=highlight>莉娅女士</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC776A970046BCF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1311222102":{"text":"连<style=\"highlight\">莉娅女士</style>都劝说我，不让我出门。唉，她以前都会帮我偷偷准备修花剪的！","source_cn":"连莉娅女士都劝说我，不让我出门。唉，她以前都会帮我偷偷准备修花剪的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC776A970046BCF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311222103:0":{"text":"罗德里戈，你今天怎么了？咳，莉娅女士是城堡的女管家呀！","source_cn":"罗德里戈，你今天怎么了？咳，莉娅女士是城堡的女管家呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410F03FC1EC9C9D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311222104:0":{"text":"你还没来城堡担任护卫的时候她就在照顾我了。","source_cn":"你还没来城堡担任护卫的时候她就在照顾我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282A4A42DEDBF0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_